It provides the trust layer that all of them are missing.
Every market where irreversible transactions fail
because parties cannot verify each other is a BETE market.
Every dollar lost to fraud, coercion, or manipulation
that a deterministic evidence layer would have prevented
is a BETE revenue opportunity.
The addressable market is not a sector.
It is a condition: the absence of neutral trust.
That condition exists in every economy,
every language, every caste, every border,
and every context where two parties must transact
without being able to verify each other directly.
That is the market.
Truth is earned through evidence.
Trust is composed from truth.
Integrity compounds across generations.
